Release v2.7
– save-ref: the link target and the label are created with \MakeLinkTarget and
  \label when hyperref is loaded.
– Tagged PDF: lists whose label does not use the counter, for example label={},
  are now declared as unordered lists.
– Tagged PDF: in enumext and keyans a label wider than \labelwidth no longer
  overlaps the text and tall labels are no longer smashed.
– The documentation is now a tagged PDF (PDF/UA-2).
